kgpe-d16 QEMU shim: relocate the pre-console buffer off the nonexistent
G3 SRAM (0x1E720000, the A2P/PCI window) into low DRAM.

Companion to 0004: the AST2050 has no SRAM at 0x1E720000 (writes there
forward to the empty PCI bus), so the pre-console log buffer must not live
there. QEMU-only shim; DRAM is present from reset.

diff --git a/configs/evb-ast2400_defconfig b/configs/evb-ast2400_defconfig
index 0706c384..8ebeae8d 100644
--- a/configs/evb-ast2400_defconfig
+++ b/configs/evb-ast2400_defconfig
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@ CONFIG_BOOTARGS="console=ttyS4,115200n8 root=/dev/ram rw"
 CONFIG_USE_BOOTCOMMAND=y
 CONFIG_BOOTCOMMAND="bootm 20100000"
 CONFIG_PRE_CONSOLE_BUFFER=y
-CONFIG_PRE_CON_BUF_ADDR=0x1e720000
+CONFIG_PRE_CON_BUF_ADDR=0x40100000
 CONFIG_SYS_CONSOLE_ENV_OVERWRITE=y
 CONFIG_HUSH_PARSER=y
 # CONFIG_AUTO_COMPLETE is not set
